==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*slušati}}, from an earlier {{m|sla-pro||*sluxěti}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*ḱlew-}}, whence {{cog|en|listen}} and {{cog|sa|श्रोषति||to listen, obey}}.

===Pronunciation===
